## The asset you're underrating

You hand-labelled a set and measured the judge against it. **Almost nobody does this.** Most people who build an LLM-judge eval stop at "I have a judge" and never ask whether the judge is correct. You went one level up — that's meta-evaluation, and it's the difference between a metric and a number.

